  m_Name: Evento_RepasseFederal
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Repasse Federal
  _titleEn: Federal Transfer
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Parte dos impostos arrecadados pela Uni\xE3o volta aos munic\xEDpios
    em repasses obrigat\xF3rios e volunt\xE1rios."
  _summaryEn: Part of the taxes collected by the federal government returns to municipalities
    through mandatory and discretionary transfers.
  _realWorld: "O Fundo de Participa\xE7\xE3o dos Munic\xEDpios, previsto na Constitui\xE7\xE3o,
    \xE9 a principal fonte de receita de grande parte das cidades pequenas brasileiras."
  _realWorldEn: The Municipal Participation Fund, set out in Brazil's Constitution,
    is the main source of revenue for many small Brazilian cities.
  _tradeOffs: "Depender de repasses deixa a cidade sem controle sobre o pr\xF3prio
    or\xE7amento."
  _tradeOffsEn: Depending on transfers leaves the city without control over its own
    budget.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Fundo de Participa\xE7\xE3o dos Munic\xEDpios (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fundo_de_Participa%C3%A7%C3%A3o_dos_Munic%C3%ADpios
  - Label: "Constitui\xE7\xE3o Federal (Planalto)"
    Url: https://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/constituicao/constituicao.htm
